{"title":"Update Log/Version 1.45.0","slug":"Update_Log%2FVersion_1.45.0","hero":{"file":"FestiveAxe.webp","width":168,"height":264},"pageid":1939,"revid":20585,"timestamp":"2025-11-29T06:09:54Z","lastEditor":"Juan Sebastian Chung","categories":["Events"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"additions","text":"Additions"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<p>The <b>2023 Christmas Update</b> (<a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Version_1.45.0/\">v1.45.0</a>) was introduced on December 10th, 2023. It introduced a large amount of new items and new resources (tables below), and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowlands/\">Snowlands</a>. The Snowlands contain <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snow_Tree/\">Snow Trees</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Icestone/\">Icestone</a>. \n</p><p>Meteor crashes were changed to Gift Drops (unofficial name) in this update, making <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Meteor_Core/\">Meteor Cores</a> unobtainable for the duration. Gift Drops happen at the same location as meteor crashes, and spawn Christmas-related items and gifts. The gifts could no longer be purchased after December 24th.\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"additions\">Additions</h2>\n<p>In the tables below is a list of the new items, resources, and other changes.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"new-items\">New Items</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><b>Picture</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Name</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Price</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Shop</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Type</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: FestiveAxe\">FestiveAxe</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Festive_Axe/\">Festive Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td>$16,900\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lighthouse/\">Lighthouse</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/category/Tools/\">Tool</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Christmas Wreath\">Christmas Wreath</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Christmas_Wreath/\">Christmas Wreath</a>\n</td>\n<td>$1,045\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Stocking\">Stocking</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Stocking/\">Stocking</a>\n</td>\n<td>$450\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: CandyCane\">CandyCane</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candy_Cane/\">Candy Cane</a>\n</td>\n<td>$700\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cocoa\">Cocoa</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hot_Cocoa/\">Hot Cocoa</a>\n</td>\n<td>$900\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Missing Image\">Missing Image</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Toy_Train/\">Toy Train</a>\n</td>\n<td>$2,400\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Missing Image\">Missing Image</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Menorach/\">Menorah</a>\n</td>\n<td>$1,400\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>\n</td>\n<td>Object\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Missin