ud\n<p>(needs testing)\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>$35/stud\n<p>(needs testing)\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"other\">Other</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th>\n<th>Item?\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Missing Image\">Missing Image</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowlands/\">Snowlands</a>\n</td>\n<td>SE of Lighthouse\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>For this update, the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Scientist/\">Junior Scientist</a>'s dialogue was changed.</li>\n<li>This update introduced a new most expensive item to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">Oak Depot</a>, being the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gift_of_Christmas/\">Gift of Christmas</a>. This item is valued at $75,000, compared to the previous most expensive item, the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber/\">Grabbiest Grabber</a>, at $47,999 (Now the Grabby Grabber is also priced at $75,000).</li></ul>"}
